  measured, not argued). Objective twoStage. Antoine log10(Psat/bar) =
  7.287831 - 3246.8966/(T + 46.1092), in-sample R2 0.998315 over 29
  points, 277.9-316.3 K. HELD OUT: 25 points, AAD 8.3129 % (max 11.9823
  %) against the band 2.2 % -> notValidated; the stage-1 least-squares
  answer on the same points: AAD 12.9406 %, max 40.0319 %. Its own normal
