  and Tnb within 1 K (superseded by the graded acceptance of C285): WHAT
  THE RUN FOUND (pinned in `expected`; measured, not argued). Objective
  twoStage. Antoine log10(Psat/bar) = 5.281864 - 2003.2539/(T +
  -27.7427), in-sample R2 0.999092 over 69 kept points, 273.15-447.8 K
  (10.1021/je049761y 29/29 kept; 10.1016/j.jct.2013.03.020 25/25 kept;
  10.1021/je101259r 15/15 kept). Relative error in P over the kept
  points: mean 5.3080 %, max 8.5056 %; AmbroseWalton on the same points:
  mean 37.1625 %, max 63.9790 %. Outliers discarded: none. Its own normal
  boiling point (101.325 kPa): 407.42 K. NOT PROMOTED by the DEFAULT
  acceptance of DEV.md 4c C283 (no system/curationDict): 3 studies, 69
  points kept, 0 discarded as outliers; max relative error 8.506 % (mean
  5.308 %) against 5 %; AmbroseWalton on the same points mean 37.16 % /
  max 63.98 %; the record keeps AmbroseWalton. THEN C285, every usable
  study fitted over its WHOLE measured range (superseded by the fit
  window of C367): WHAT THE RUN FOUND (pinned in `expected`; measured,
  not argued). Objective twoStage. Antoine log10(Psat/bar) = 5.281864 -
  2003.2539/(T + -27.7427), in-sample R2 0.999092 over 69 kept points,
  273.15-447.8 K (10.1021/je049761y 29/29 kept; 10.1016/j.jct.2013.03.020
  25/25 kept; 10.1021/je101259r 15/15 kept). Relative error in P over the
  kept points: mean 5.3080 %, max 8.5056 %; AmbroseWalton on the same
  points: mean 37.1625 %, max 63.9790 %. Outliers discarded: none. Its
  own normal boiling point (101.325 kPa): 407.42 K. PROMOTED on
  2026-11-10 into data/standards/components/dimethylethanolamine.dat as
  reviewStatus autoPromoted, humanReviewed false, because: fit grade
  warning under the DEFAULT graded acceptance of DEV.md 4c C285 (no
